  "details": "Of all the Default Av3 Parameters, I am in need of one that doesn't exist, Eye Rotation.\n\nThis would be especially useful for animating 2D texture Eyes. I would like a Float for Vertical ranging from -1 to +1 and Horizontal -1 to +1.\n\nPerhaps name it \"EyeRotationX\" and \"EyeRotationY\"?\n\nAlso a Bool for Randomized Blinking would be a nice-to-have, but not as important as that can be animated",
